Tiny KWS Noise Calibration

The MFCC front end and quantization workflow adapt the MLPerf Tiny keyword
spotting implementation by MLCommons and upstream contributors. See the
upstream project at https://github.com/mlcommons/tiny and its Apache 2.0
license at commit 4addd0fa08d216e20637637874e084895f289da4.

The benchmark checkpoint and audio datasets are fetched from their respective
upstream sources. See THIRD_PARTY.md for attribution and license information.
